Field Meaning <code>test_level</code> Map of tier to the test level <code>validate</code> and <code>deploy</code> use: <code>NoTestRun</code>, <code>RunSpecifiedTests</code>, <code>RunLocalTests</code> or <code>RunAllTestsInOrg</code>. The <code>default</code> key applies to any tier not listed <code>delta.enabled</code> <code>false</code> makes <code>plan</code> list the whole source instead of a delta <code>deploy.quick</code> <code>prefer</code> (the default), <code>require</code> or <code>off</code>. See validation binding <code>ephemeral.seed</code> <code>minimal</code> (the default), <code>full</code> or <code>off</code>. See the smart seed <code>engine</code>, <code>api_version</code> Accepted by the schema (<code>native</code>, and <code>auto</code> or a version such as <code>62.0</code>). No command reads them yet <pre><code>salesforce:
  test_level: { default: RunLocalTests, prod: RunLocalTests }
  deploy: { quick: prefer }
  ephemeral: { seed: minimal }
</code></pre>
